; WBGapTest.script: amicradle-teams designs/OPENBENCH-GAPS-20261112.md's automatic rows, in a lab, on
; GFOpenBench and on OS 3.2.3's Workbench alike. Needs WBGapTest, WBGapRexx.rexx, WBGapLayout.rexx, WBGapDesk.rexx,
; WBGapCheck.script and DragTest in SYS:T/WBGap (from build.sh's out dir). MENUS reads with RAM:WBGap's
; drawer window open, so the drawer menus are in it. It prints PASS, FAIL, SKIP and INFO lines, and saves them to RAM:wbgap-results.
; RAM:wbgap-report is the same as one PASS, FAIL or SKIP line per gap id (WBGapTest REPORT).
; Then: WBGapTest STARTUP SETUP has been run here, so the WBStartup rows need a reboot and
; "Execute SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapCheck.script" after it, which gives the whole report.
; MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 AmiCradle Team.
FailAt 21
CD SYS:T/WBGap
Echo "INFO WBGapTest run on" NOLINE
Version workbench.library
WBGapTest SETUP >NIL:
DragTest OPEN RAM:WBGap
Wait 2
WBGapTest MENUS DUMP >RAM:wbgap-menus
WBGapTest MENUS >RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest MENUDRIVE >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest API >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest NOTIFY >>RAM:wbgap-results
If NOT EXISTS SYS:Rexxc/rx
  Echo "SKIP R1 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R2 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R1b no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP R2b no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP L1a no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP D5 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
  Echo "SKIP D1 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
Else
  Run >NIL: SYS:System/RexxMast >NIL:
  Wait 1
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapRexx.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapRexx.rexx OPENBENCH >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapX4.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapX3.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapF3.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  WBGapTest LAYOUT >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapLayout.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapRoot.rexx >>RAM:wbgap-results
  WBGapTest DISKS >>RAM:wbgap-results
  WBGapTest DISKIO RAD: >>RAM:wbgap-results
EndIf
WBGapTest SCREENS >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest BIG >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest LAUNCH >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest SWITCH >>RAM:wbgap-results
If EXISTS SYS:Rexxc/rx
  WBGapTest LAUNCHDESK SETUP >>RAM:wbgap-results
  SYS:Rexxc/rx SYS:T/WBGap/WBGapDesk.rexx SYS:T/WBGap/DragTest >>RAM:wbgap-results
  WBGapTest LAUNCHDESK CHECK >>RAM:wbgap-results
  WBGapTest LAUNCHDESK DONE >NIL:
Else
  Echo "SKIP I11 no rx" >>RAM:wbgap-results
EndIf
If EXISTS WBGapIndex
  WBGapIndex >>RAM:wbgap-results
EndIf
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapA QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapB QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapC QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapD QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapE QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapF QUIET
Copy WBGapTest SYS:WBStartup/WBGapG QUIET
WBGapTest STARTUP SETUP >>RAM:wbgap-results
WBGapTest REPORT RAM:wbgap-results >RAM:wbgap-report
Type RAM:wbgap-report
Copy RAM:wbgap-results RAM:wbgap-menus RAM:wbgap-report SYS:T/WBGap/ QUIET
